# AI STL Creation Factory

This project implements an AI-driven STL generation factory that creates printable 3D models from CAD descriptions generated by a Groq-hosted LLM, validates them, archives them, and exposes a control dashboard.

## Goals

- Generate STL models across 9 design categories automatically
- Run locally or in the cloud
- Schedule jobs internally with APScheduler
- Dynamically rotate Groq API keys on rate-limit errors
- Use Telegram + Google Drive for notifications and archival
- Offer a Flask dashboard for manual triggers and config

